    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayadormgen.webp",
      "alt": "mayadormgen"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you do things like this?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ": 你为什么要做这种事？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maya begrudgingly hangs out in her room with me as she 'doesn't have enough energy to leave.'",
      "zh": "Maya 勉为其难地在屋里陪我待着，因为「她没力气离开」。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Of course, she spends most of this time either ignoring me or trying to educate me about the universe.",
      "zh": "当然，这段时间她大部分时候要么无视我，要么试图给我讲宇宙的道理。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm unable to follow any of it, but I'm at least glad that she isn't calling the police.",
      "zh": "我一句都跟不上，但至少我挺高兴她没报警。"
    },
    {
      "en": "It has become a personal goal to have Maya accept me, and I feel like moments like this will get us there one step at a time...",
      "zh": "让 Maya 接纳我成了我的个人目标，而我觉得这样的时刻会让我们一次前进一小步……"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...But as soon as I finish thinking that, she kicks me out of the room and I am forced to walk back home alone...",
      "zh": "……可我刚想完，她就把我踢出了房间，我只好一个人走回家……"
    },
